      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Universal LoRA Remapper loads any LoRA format (Kohya, Diffusers, PEFT) with Anima's key mapping; strip_llm_adapter keeps the text adapter untouched.\n\nLoRA Block Weight sets the LoRA strength per DiT block group. Measured influence: blocks 10-14 > 15-19 ~ 00-09 > 20-23 > 24-27; where a LoRA acts differs per LoRA, so tune by eye.\n\nThe bottom group writes new LoRA files and is bypassed: LoRA Extractor (tuned - base model, truncated SVD), LoRA Resize (exact rank reduction) and LoRA Merger (two LoRAs into one). Enable a node with Ctrl+B and queue."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Universal LoRA Remapper loads any LoRA format (Kohya, Diffusers, PEFT) with Anima's key mapping; strip_llm_adapter keeps the text adapter untouched.\n\nLoRA Block Weight sets the LoRA strength per DiT block group. Measured influence: blocks 10-14 > 15-19 ~ 00-09 > 20-23 > 24-27; where a LoRA acts differs per LoRA, so tune by eye.\n\nThe bottom group writes new LoRA files and is bypassed: LoRA Extractor (tuned - base model, truncated SVD), LoRA Resize (exact rank reduction) and LoRA Merger (two LoRAs into one). Enable a node with Ctrl+B and queue."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
